        <mxCell id="c122" value="&lt;i&gt;Outlined: the first tied pair, FUR-DSK-0083 and FUR-TBL-0008, both 1.99 hours. They share rank 7 and the default running total 16.50, because the default window runs through the peers of the current row; ROW_NUMBER gives them 8 and 7, and the ROWS frame totals 16.50 and 14.51, in the order the window met the pair, which is not the order of the result and can differ between SQLite versions. The grid is the first 10 rows of the Furniture items.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="796" width="860" height="57" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
